herdbook-tabs is a modified copy of the `tabs` mod shipped with the Herdr
desktop app 0.1.16 (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under
the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this folder).

Changes from the original: a tab with several panes on screen lists each
pane's icon and name (`pane-name` label, Herdr 0.1.17+ `pane.name`, or Herdr's
label), and each segment can be dragged out on its own; a tab someone named
shows all icons and its name. Naming helpers live in names.js, and drag.js
provides native + pure-JS cross-panel drag. A right-click opens herdbook-menu
and + opens launch-menu when installed. With any visible sibling block after it
in a row (such as `frost` or `usage-meter` in `tabs-row`), right padding
tightens to 3px instead of 10px. Asset paths were renamed by Herdr's mod.clone.
